  "zh": "# 习近平访美结束与熊猫外交引关注，国内油价调控及基建项目推进\n## 政治与外交\n- **习近平美国国事访问结束**：中美元首会晤释放稳定关系信号，后续合作空间值得观察。\n- **大熊猫赴美计划**：两国通过熊猫外交加深民间友好，象征中美关系新窗口。\n## 经济与基建\n- **国家油价调控措施**：国家出手稳油价旨在缓解通胀压力，对企业和居民生活有直接影响。\n- **平陆运河首航越南**：新航线降低物流成本，促进西南地区对东盟贸易便利化。\n- **四条新高铁开通**：高速 rail 网络扩张提升区域连通性，将激发沿线经济活动。\n## 科技与监管\n- **美国认定Anthropic供应链风险**：将AI巨头列为供应链风险凸显监管趋严，企业需评估合规成本。\n- **微软终止个人AI聊天机器人**：放弃低端聊天机器人竞赛表明微软聚焦Copilot生态，技术路线更集中。\n- **Meta因剑桥分析公司案被判责任**：该判决强化数据隐私法律后果，提醒平台加强用户信息保护。",
  "en": "# Xi Jinping's US visit ends amid panda diplomacy, while China adjusts oil prices and pushes infrastructure projects\n## Politics & Diplomacy\n- **Xi Jinping US state visit concludes**：The summit signals a willingness to stabilize relations, opening space for future cooperation worth watching.\n- **China sends giant pandas to United States**：Panda diplomacy renews soft‑power ties, offering a fresh window for bilateral engagement.\n## Economy & Infrastructure\n- **China implements oil price control measures**：Government intervention aims to curb inflation, directly affecting businesses and household budgets.\n- **Platform Land River canal first cargo ship reaches Vietnam**：The new trade lane cuts logistics costs and boosts Southwest‑ASEAN commerce.\n- **Four new high‑speed rail lines to open**：Expanded high‑speed rail network improves regional connectivity and will stimulate local economic activity.\n## Tech & Regulation\n- **US upholds Anthropic AI supply‑chain risk designation**：Labeling Anthropic as a supply‑chain risk shows tightening AI oversight, prompting firms to assess compliance costs.\n- **Microsoft ends personal AI chatbot race with Copilot reboot**：By abandoning low‑end chatbots, Microsoft focuses its AI strategy on the Copilot ecosystem, streamlining development.\n- **Meta held liable in Cambridge Analytica data case**：The verdict reinforces data‑privacy legal consequences, urging platforms to strengthen user‑information protection."
